      "Provides a GitHub Actions pipeline template for Node.js application delivery.",
      "Includes Docker, Docker Compose, Kubernetes, Helm, ArgoCD, External Secrets, and Terraform examples.",
      "Describes rolling, blue-green, and canary deployment strategies.",
      "Supplies deployment checklist items for pre-deployment, release, and post-deployment review."
